    "AppDescription": "Dynamics 365 expense management mobile app to perform the following tasks: \n\n-> Create and Manage expenses. \n\nUsers can create expenses and comprehensive expense reports, utilize OCR technology to capture receipts and extract essential details, manage receipts by creating, attaching, detaching, and deleting them, and save, submit, or recall expense reports as per their needs. This all-in-one solution simplifies the entire expense management process, ensuring efficiency and accuracy. \n\n-> Manage expense approval: \n\nUsers have the ability to approve, reject, or delegate expense reports effortlessly through the expense management mobile application.",
